Wait — careful: currently `_onSave` calls `_reload()` (without setState). The state DOES update (sourceCaption recomputes only on next build). So after `await tester.tap(...); await tester.pump();` — does pump trigger a rebuild? `tester.pump()` schedules a frame; a frame rebuilds widgets whose state was marked dirty. Without setState, no dirty → the section rebuilds only if ancestors rebuild (MaterialApp doesn't rebuild for no reason). The snackbar (`faui.showFahSnack`) insertion might rebuild the overlay (Scaffold), but not necessarily this section. So the assertion "caption updated" is RED without the fix. 

