  // to the user home) — the "project" choice silently landing in the
  // user file. The caller contract: project requires a projectDir.
  throw ArgumentError('layer project requires a projectDir');
}
```

The guard sits before the `value == null` branch, so both the set path and the `_removeYamlKey` clear path are covered — the remove path can no longer touch a `null/.fah/config.yaml` path either.

